{
  "A color field with a popup picker, or the picker on its own. The picker has a saturation and brightness area, a hue slider, an opacity slider, channel inputs and preset colors.": "",
  "Color field": "",
  "Type a hex value or any `rgb(…)` form, or open the picker. The value is stored as hex. Every prop accepts a value or a function.": "",
  "Standalone picker": "",
  "OK and Cancel buttons": "",
  "In the area, arrow keys change saturation (Left, Right) and brightness (Up, Down). On a slider, they change hue or opacity. Shift moves in steps of 10.": "",
  "Moves to either end of a slider.": "",
  "In the color box, opens the picker.": "",
  "In the color box, applies the typed hex value.": "",
  "Sliders named “Saturation and brightness”, “Hue” and “Opacity”, which announce their position in the kit language.": "",
  "Kit text and number boxes, each with a label (Hex, Red, Green, Blue, Opacity).": "",
  "Buttons named by their color. The selected one is pressed (`aria-pressed`).": "",
  "A dialog named “Choose color”. Focus moves to the area and returns to the box when it closes.": "",
  "The picker. `data-alpha`.": "Seçici. `data-alpha`.",
  "The area, the sliders and their handles.": "",
  "The rest of the picker.": "Seçicinin geri kalanı.",
  "The color box and its parts.": "",
  "Units: corners, the handle's ring and focus state, and the hover, selected and focus states of a preset.": "",
  "The sizes and spacing of the picker.": "",
  "The checkerboard behind a transparent color.": "",
  "The swatch in the box and the spacing in the popup.": "",
  "ColorBox props": "ColorBox prop'ları",
  "The color, stored as `#rrggbb` (`#rrggbbaa` with `alpha`). Any `#…` or `rgb(…)` form is accepted. `x-model` provides two-way binding.": "",
  "Adds an opacity slider and input, and the value keeps its opacity.": "",
  "Preset colors in the popup.": "",
  "With `instantly`, the value follows every change in the popup. With `useButtons`, it changes on OK, and Cancel discards the change.": "",
  "Shows a button that clears the field.": "",
  "Displayed when the field is empty.": "",
  "All standard field props. Text that is not a color is reported as invalid.": "",
  "ColorBox properties, methods and events": "ColorBox property'leri, method'ları ve event'leri",
  "Opens or closes the picker (Alt+Down also opens it).": "",
  "Indicates whether the picker is open.": "",
  "Occurs when the picker opens or closes (with the reason).": "",
  "The `ColorPicker` in the popup, after it has been opened.": "",
  "Clears the value.": "",
  "ColorPicker props": "ColorPicker prop'ları",
  "The color, updated with every change. `x-model` provides two-way binding.": "",
  "Adds an opacity slider and input.": "",
  "Preset colors that can be selected with one click.": "",
  "Shows the hex and red, green and blue inputs.": "",
  "Shows a button that picks a color from the screen, in browsers that support EyeDropper.": "",
  "Occurs when the color changes (`value`), either through user input or programmatically (`byUser`).": "",
